  "title": "Homemade Mozzarella Cheese",
  "description": "Learn how to make mozzarella cheese from scratch with this straightforward recipe that turns whole milk into deliciously fresh mozzarella cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "ChefJackie"
  ],
